 "yawRule": "MC yaw (0=+z south, 90=-x west, 180=-z north, -90=+x east). Each prop model has its front on +Z and ItemDisplayRenderer turns it 180deg, so a prop gets the yaw of the person looking at its front (chair = the seated agent, laptop/monitor/mug = the seated agent, wall props = the viewer facing the wall).",
